      "description": "Watch Real Sociedad vs Espanyol highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The stands were packed on August 29, 2026 , for a high-stakes La Liga encounter. Both Real Sociedad and Espanyol looked to establish dominance early on in a match that provided drama until the very last second. Early Breakthrough and Halftime Twist Real Sociedad wasted no time in making their mark on the game. In just the 4th minute, Mikel Oyarzabal provided a clinical assist for Ander Barrenetxea , who slotted the ball home with his right foot to give the hosts an early lead. The home side continued to press, searching for a second goal, but they were met with a disciplined defensive line from the visitors. However, Espanyol found a way back into the contest just as the first half was drawing to a close. In the 45th minute, Javi Hernández delivered a dangerous cross that found Roberto Fernández , who executed a perfect volley into the back of the net. The equalizer stunned the home crowd and ensured the teams went into the break level at 1-1. Óskarsson’s Decisive Strike and Late Drama The narrative shifted again in the second half when Real Sociedad regained their advantage. In the 61st minute, Mikel Oyarzabal recorded his second assist of the match, finding Orri Óskarsson , who finished with composure to make it 2-1. Espanyol fought hard to stay in the game, even clearing an Óskarsson effort off the goal line in the 72nd minute to keep their hopes alive. The closing stages were frantic, characterized by a flurry of yellow cards as tempers flared. In the 4th minute of stoppage time, the referee showed a red card to Pellegrino Matarazzo for unsportsmanlike conduct, adding to the late-game chaos. Despite a final push from Espanyol , the 31,884 fans in attendance witnessed Real Sociedad hold on for a deserved victory."
