      "description": "Watch Espanyol vs Real Madrid highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 22, 2026. A hard-fought battle in La Liga On August 22, 2026, Espanyol and Real Madrid met in a gripping La Liga encounter that tested the resolve of both sides. The atmosphere at the stadium was electric from the start, as the visitors looked to assert their dominance while the home side remained compact and dangerous on the counter-attack. Real Madrid drew first blood in the 9th minute when Jude Bellingham rose high to head home an Arda Guler delivery. Espanyol refused to be intimidated, however, and clawed their way back into the contest in the 30th minute. Alex Calatrava found the back of the net after a clever assist from Javi Hernandez , leveling the playing field and turning the match into a tactical stalemate for much of the following hour. Late drama secures the points As the game entered the final minutes, the intensity reached a boiling point. The deadlock was finally broken in the 90th minute when Carlos Espi capitalized on a golden opportunity set up by Kylian Mbappe , firing past the keeper to put the visitors back in front. Despite the late attempts by Espanyol to salvage a point—which saw Pere Milla and Pol Lozano booked for dissent—the clock ran out on the hosts. Real Madrid finished the match with 63% possession, successfully navigating the pressure to secure a hard-fought victory."
